    <string name="import_supported_formats">Export your notes from the other app, then choose the files here (you can pick several, or a .zip).\n\n• Google Keep (Google Takeout .zip or .tgz)\n• Evernote (.enex)\n• Joplin (.jex, or a .zip of a Markdown export)\n• Simplenote, Standard Notes, Fossify Notes (.zip or .json)\n• Obsidian, Notesnook, Bear and other Markdown apps (.md or .zip)\n• Any app that exports plain text (.txt): converted to Markdown\n• HTML (.html) and note JSON (Notally, Omni Notes…)\n• Black Pearl and Quillpad backups\n\nYour current notes stay as they are: imported notes are added, with their checklists, pictures, tags and notebooks.</string>
